Subject: [PATCH] Kite: validate MT7916 RXD and publish complete RX chains

Retain protected/high-WCID frames for host processing. Add an explicit diagnostic
ABI query without advertising safe Linux ownership, stop or PPE capabilities.
This patch does not enable WiFi offload. Upstream: 735529c10d5120e10f7e4a6ddf97fb384fce9903.

